= Gottfried Treviranus

Gottfried Treviranus was a member of the <span style="color: #3f7bc1;">**DNVP**</span>'s moderate wing. He advocate for continuation and normalization of the Republic.

- @criticize_the_far_right
- @rally_for_the_republic
- @build_peoples_conservative
- @root: Return to main

@criticize_the_far_right
title: Criticize the national opposition
subtitle: Despite being a nationalist himself, Treviranus has long opposed their radical policies.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; dnf_relation -= 4; dnvp_relation -= 4 if dnvp_ideology = "Radical"; workers_dnf -= 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_dnf -= 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_dnf -= 3*(1-dissent); rural_dnf -= 3*(1-dissent); workers_dnvp -= 3*(1-dissent) if dnvp_ideology = "Radical"; new_middle_dnvp -= 3*(1-dissent) if dnvp_ideology = "Radical"; old_middle_dnvp -= 3*(1-dissent) if dnvp_ideology = "Radical"; rural_dnvp -= 3*(1-dissent) if dnvp_ideology = "Radical"

We raise alarm at the national opposition's policies and rhetoric. Having a known naitonalist speak out against them has hurt their appeal among even their base.


@rally_for_the_republic
title: Rally for the Republic
subtitle: Rally our party and the German people to defend the Republic.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pro_republic += 5; democratization += 1; workers_dvp += 1*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_dvp += 2*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; old_middle_dvp += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; rural_dvp += 1*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4;

Treviranus helps us to rally the people in defense of the Republic.


@build_peoples_conservative
title: Build the People's Conservative
subtitle: Increase support for the People's Conservative faction.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
